WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.000
Once upon a time in a beautiful land far away

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.200
lived a happy young girl named Ella.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:12.020
Ella lived with her father who loved her very much.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:16.320
Their days were full of sunshine.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.039
Higher, Daddy. Higher.

00:00:19.039 --> 00:00:24.720
But sadness came when her father passed away, leaving Ella all alone.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.840
Her stepmother, Lady Tremaine, was cold and unkind.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.840
She took over the house.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.750
She brought her two daughters, Anastasia and Drizella,

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:43.600
who were loud and messy. They treated poor Ella like a servant.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.719
They even changed her name.

00:00:46.719 --> 00:00:52.680
The ball is tonight, Ella. Enjoy your scrubbing.

00:00:53.199 --> 00:00:58.879
Look at her. She is covered in cinders and dirt.

00:00:58.879 --> 00:01:02.160
Let's call her Cinderella.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:07.159
Yes, Cinderella the Maid.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:13.000
From that day on, Cinderella worked from sunrise to sunset.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.600
She cooked the meals, washed the dishes, and cleaned the clothes.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:30.758
Yet, despite their cruelty, Cinderella remained kind and gentle.

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:38.359
Don't worry, little friends. Someday things will be better.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:45.000
Cinderella lived in a dusty attic high up in the tower.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:51.320
She dreamed of a life where she could be free and happy.

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:58.470
One morning a royal messenger arrived with exciting news.
